--- !u!114 &880000005
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1452637454}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b8d5f02a3c9e5f7b0a2d4e6f8b9c0d1e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPC
  speakerName: Cat Kid Boy
  dialoguePages:
  - Kit!! Did you smash more of Malice's robots today? Please say yes!
  - You're the coolest.
  - "I was digging for bugs under the porch and found a paper! It said hold attack
    to charge\u2014medium and big shots hurt way more!"
  dialoguePagesMalice:
  - G-go away, Malice! Boss of the mean robots!
  - Kit says you're trouble. I believe Kit.
  - I found paper in my lunchbox. It talked about bouncing shots with a slash. Don't
    bounce anything at MY bike!
  dialoguePagesCount:
  - Count!! You make time go weird and suddenly the robots are all stuck! That's
    so cool!
  - When you slow everything down, even grown-ups stop yelling. I like that.
  - "Paper fell out of my comic book. Said if you burn all sixteen Hyper Speed seconds
    you get weak for a bit\u2014fire slower, charge only halfway. Don't waste it!"
  dialoguePagesHarlie:
  - Harlie your sword goes SHING SHING! Best sound ever!
  - You cut Malice's bots. Perfect.
  - "I found paper inside my pillowcase somehow?? Jump-attack down onto their heads\u2014pogo
    style\u2014then keep swinging!"
  interactRadius: {fileID: 0}
  interactCollider: {fileID: 0}
  interactableSymbolBox: {fileID: 0}
  interactSymbolPrefab: {fileID: 4100001001001001004, guid: e1a8c35d6f2b8c0e3d5a7b9c1e2f3a4b, type: 3}
  interactSymbolInstance: {fileID: 0}
  stickUpThreshold: 0.5
  shopAfterDialogue: {fileID: 0}
