--- !u!114 &880000006
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 423258035}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b8d5f02a3c9e5f7b0a2d4e6f8b9c0d1e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPC
  speakerName: Cat Kid Girl
  dialoguePages:
  - Kit, tell Malice to stop her robots stomping the flower pots!
  - You always come home. That matters.
  - "Mommy was baking and a paper was under the flour tin. It said while you shoot
    on the ground you stand still\u2026 unless you're charging with the pink aura!
    Flour everywhere after that."
  dialoguePagesMalice:
  - Malice you're mean. Boss mean. Army mean.
  - Go away.
  - I found paper in my dollhouse. It talked about grapples. Pull yourself OUT of
    our town.
  dialoguePagesCount:
  - "Count, your Hyper Speed is pretty\u2026 the whole street goes soft and quiet."
  - You slow Malice's robots. I clap.
  - "Paper was stuck to my jump rope. Up-Hyper makes YOUR shots crawl too\u2014use
    it when you want careful aim. Down-Hyper if you still want zippy bullets!"
  dialoguePagesHarlie:
  - Harlie!! Sword princess!!
  - You win against the bad robots.
  - "I found paper in the flower bed while watering. Finish your sword combo\u2014don't
    stop halfway or the bots recover!"
  interactRadius: {fileID: 0}
  interactCollider: {fileID: 0}
  interactableSymbolBox: {fileID: 0}
  interactSymbolPrefab: {fileID: 4100001001001001004, guid: e1a8c35d6f2b8c0e3d5a7b9c1e2f3a4b, type: 3}
  interactSymbolInstance: {fileID: 0}
