--- !u!114 &880000007
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 903642433}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b8d5f02a3c9e5f7b0a2d4e6f8b9c0d1e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPC
  speakerName: Blonde Cat Woman
  dialoguePages:
  - "Kit\u2014market's clear thanks to you. Malice tried another daylight raid."
  - Proud of you.
  - "While restocking jars I found a scrap of paper tucked behind the jam. Dash toward
    trouble, but dash-jump keeps your speed until you land. Odd inventory tip\u2026
    oddly useful."
  dialoguePagesMalice:
  - Malice. Shop's closed to tyrants today. Window's expensive.
  - Army boss or not, don't scuff my awning.
  - "A paper slipped out of the cash box while I counted coins. Whatever it said
    about your charge moves\u2014practice them far from my stall."
  dialoguePagesCount:
  - "Count, dear\u2014your Hyper Speed kept my customers calm during the last raid.
    Thank you."
  - You outclass Malice's whole parade just by giving us room to breathe.
  - "Paper was folded into a receipt stack. Hyper Speed isn't tied to charge\u2014toggle
    it when you need it, then land clean clock shots. Panic-burning the whole timer
    wastes the gift\u2014and my nerves."
  dialoguePagesHarlie:
  - "Harlie\u2014elegant blade work. Malice's bots look almost embarrassed."
  - Keep that sword between us and her army.
  - While sweeping under the counter I found paper stuck to a broom straw. Mix grounded
    combos with aerial pogo hits so they can't plant their feet.
  interactRadius: {fileID: 0}
  interactCollider: {fileID: 0}
  interactableSymbolBox: {fileID: 0}
  interactSymbolPrefab: {fileID: 4100001001001001004, guid: e1a8c35d6f2b8c0e3d5a7b9c1e2f3a4b, type: 3}
