--- !u!114 &880000008
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1437791577}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b8d5f02a3c9e5f7b0a2d4e6f8b9c0d1e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPC
  speakerName: Blonde Cat man
  dialoguePages:
  - Kit. Heard Malice's bots rattled the north fence. You heading out?
  - Need a hand, shout.
  - "Was fixing the mailbox and a paper was jammed in the slot\u2014no stamp. Said
    you can change attack styles from the menu; Spread and Machine Gun change how
    shots behave. Check it if you forget."
  dialoguePagesMalice:
  - Malice. Army boss. Problem.
  - Walk soft past the kids.
  - "Paper fluttered out while I shook out a rug. Slash can reflect shots\u2014point
    the bounce at YOUR machines."
  dialoguePagesCount:
  - "Count\u2014Hyper Speed when the bots hit is proper craftsmanship. Town noticed."
  - Malice will notice fewer panicked patrols. Good. Let her notice.
  - "Found paper behind the rain barrel while scrubbing moss. Don't burn the full
    Hyper Speed pool on empty streets\u2014using it all weakens your fire for a few
    seconds. Save it for crowded packs."
  dialoguePagesHarlie:
  - Harlie. Good steel. Better judgment than half this valley.
  - Malice hates both.
  - Paper was stuck to my fishing line after a cast. Hold charge past halfway for
    the sliding kick when you need distance. Fish didn't care. I did.
  interactRadius: {fileID: 0}
  interactCollider: {fileID: 0}
  interactableSymbolBox: {fileID: 0}
  interactSymbolPrefab: {fileID: 4100001001001001004, guid: e1a8c35d6f2b8c0e3d5a7b9c1e2f3a4b, type: 3}
