    m_Bits: 0
--- !u!114 &880000011
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 47032955}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b8d5f02a3c9e5f7b0a2d4e6f8b9c0d1e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPC
  speakerName: Purple hair cat
  dialoguePages:
  - Kit, your fights with Malice's robots are basically the town's daily show.
  - Stay iconic.
  - "I was pinning posters and a paper was already behind one of them. If grounded
    shooting freezes you, that's normal\u2014charge until the aura pops to move again.
    Style AND function."
  dialoguePagesMalice:
  - Malice. Love the look. Hate the army-boss attitude.
  - Don't scuff my posters.
  - Paper slipped out of my paint kit. Slash can reflect. Reflect yourself out of
    frame, please.
  dialoguePagesCount:
  - Count! That Hyper Speed wash over Main Street? Visuals. Ten out of ten.
  - You steal the spotlight from Malice's whole parade just by pausing the panic.
  - "Found paper stuck to a glitter bottle. Up-Hyper for soft-motion drama\u2014your
    dash crawls stylishly. Down-Hyper if you still want snappy shots. Panic-firing
    in normal time is so last season."
  dialoguePagesHarlie:
  - "Harlie\u2014sword choreography goals. Malice's bots can't even pose right."
  - Your blade edits them out.
  - Paper was tucked in my sequin tin. Don't drop your combo strings; unfinished
    sequences look messy and hurt less.
  interactRadius: {fileID: 0}
  interactCollider: {fileID: 0}
  interactableSymbolBox: {fileID: 0}
  interactSymbolPrefab: {fileID: 4100001001001001004, guid: e1a8c35d6f2b8c0e3d5a7b9c1e2f3a4b, type: 3}
  interactSymbolInstance: {fileID: 0}
